better-dev is built by REIMPLEMENTING patterns and methods from the projects below.
Ideas, techniques, and system designs are not copyrightable, so reimplemented
components are original work and owe no attribution. This file (a) lists any expression
we actually copied verbatim/substantially, which MIT requires us to attribute, and
(b) credits, as a courtesy, the projects whose patterns informed better-dev.

